## Firebase + Flutter Monorepo Structure

This repository is a combined Firebase + Flutter project with three important root-level areas:

- Cloud Functions: [functions/](mdc:functions/)
  - Language: TypeScript (Node.js runtime)
  - TypeScript sources: [functions/src/](mdc:functions/src/)
  - Entrypoint: [functions/src/index.ts](mdc:functions/src/index.ts)
  - Config: [functions/package.json](mdc:functions/package.json), [functions/tsconfig.json](mdc:functions/tsconfig.json), [functions/tsconfig.dev.json](mdc:functions/tsconfig.dev.json)

- Flutter application: [_flutter_clonetrip/](mdc:_flutter_clonetrip/)
  - Main Dart entry: [_flutter_clonetrip/lib/main.dart](mdc:_flutter_clonetrip/lib/main.dart)
  - Flutter project config: [_flutter_clonetrip/pubspec.yaml](mdc:_flutter_clonetrip/pubspec.yaml)

- Firebase Hosting public root: [public/](mdc:public/)
  - Default hosting entry: [public/index.html](mdc:public/index.html)
  - Flutter web build artifacts are written here for deployment.

Additional Firebase configuration lives at the repository root:
- Hosting, emulators, and deploy config: [firebase.json](mdc:firebase.json)
- Firestore rules: [firestore.rules](mdc:firestore.rules)
- Firestore indexes: [firestore.indexes.json](mdc:firestore.indexes.json)
- Storage rules: [storage.rules](mdc:storage.rules)

## Build and Deploy Notes

- To produce the web app for Firebase Hosting, build the Flutter project to `public/`:
```bash
cd _flutter_clonetrip
flutter build web --release -o ../public
```
- Deploy Hosting and Functions together:
```bash
firebase deploy --only hosting,functions
```

## Path Conventions (for navigation and reasoning)

- `@functions/` refers to code under `functions/src/`
- `@public/` refers to assets under `public/`
- `@_flutter_clonetrip/` refers to the Flutter project root `_flutter_clonetrip/`

These aliases are for Cursor navigation and discussion. See [functions/tsconfig.json](mdc:functions/tsconfig.json) for actual compiler path settings used by Functions. Flutter/Dart imports continue to use package-style imports defined by [_flutter_clonetrip/pubspec.yaml](mdc:_flutter_clonetrip/pubspec.yaml).